<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Morocco Dream - Tours in Morocco</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#fff8ee;color:#333}
header{background:#ff7a00;color:white;text-align:center;padding:40px 20px}
header h1{font-size:36px;margin:0}
header p{font-size:18px}
.container{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:20px}
.card{background:white;border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);text-align:center;padding-bottom:20px}
.card img{width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover}
.card h2{margin:15px 0 5px}
.price{color:#ff7a00;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#25D366;color:white;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:25px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;margin-top:10px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#888}
@media(max-width:700px){.container{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>🌴 Morocco Dream</h1>
<p>Discover the Magic of Morocco - Desert, Atlas & Marrakech</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212674296071?text=Hello%20Morocco%20Dream!%20I%20want%20to%20book%20a%20tour">Chat on WhatsApp</a>
</header>
<div class="container">
<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509316785289-025f5b846b35?w=800">
<h2>🏜️ Sahara Desert</h2>
<p>2 Days - Camel Ride & Night in Desert Camp</p>
<div class="price">899 MAD</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212674296071?text=Hello!%20I%20want%20to%20book%20Sahara%20Desert%20Tour%20-%20899%20MAD">Book on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1539020140153-e479b8c22e70?w=800">
<h2>⛰️ Atlas Mountains</h2>
<p>1 Day - Berber Villages & Waterfalls</p>
<div class="price">450 MAD</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212674296071?text=Hello!%20I%20want%20to%20book%20Atlas%20Mountains%20Tour%20-%20450%20MAD">Book on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1597212618440-806262de4f6b?w=800">
<h2>🕌 Marrakech City Tour</h2>
<p>Half Day - Medina, Souks & Jemaa El Fna</p>
<div class="price">350 MAD</div>
<a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/212674296071?text=Hello!%20I%20want%20to%20book%20Marrakech%20City%20Tour%20-%20350%20MAD">Book on WhatsApp</a>
</div>
</div>
<footer>© 2026 Morocco Dream - WhatsApp: +212 674-296071</footer>
</body>
</html>
